py":-0.1847,"r5_spy":-0.1808,"r20_spy":0.0432}}],"quotes":[{"c":"GME 2017 Q4","e":"gme","d":"2018-03-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike K. Mauler","x":"Well, I'd start with, certainly, SG&A reduction is part of our strategy and that was one of the drivers in some of the restructuring we've done already this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/28/gamestop-corp-gme-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2018 Q1","e":"gme","d":"2018-05-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Lloyd","x":"So really, I would call it more of a rightsizing than an expansion of the square footage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/03/gamestop-gme-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2018 Q1","e":"gme","d":"2018-05-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rob Lloyd","x":"With our first quarter coming in line with our expectations, we're maintaining our full-year guidance consistent with our original outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/03/gamestop-gme-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2018 Q3","e":"gme","d":"2018-11-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Lloyd","x":"However, the overall sales and margin performance are not as strong as we had expected and we are reducing our full year outlook given our expectation that fourth quarter sales will skew more toward hardware than initially planned, given what we saw in November.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/29/gamestop-corp-gme-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2018 Q4","e":"gme","d":"2019-04-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel DeMatteo","x":"I want to emphasize that this is not simply a cost cutting exercise, although we are looking at ways into the future to reduce costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/02/gamestop-corp-gme-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2018 Q4",