formation, severance and other charges associated with our GameStop Reboot Profit Improvement initiative, our SG&A expenses were $436 million, reflecting a decline of $28 million or roughly 6% versus the third quarter of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/10/gamestop-corp-new-gme-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2019 Q4","e":"gme","d":"2020-03-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Bell","x":"After adjusting for roughly $23.6 million in one-time transformation, severance and other charges associated with our reboot profit improvement initiative, our adjusted SG&A expenses were $488.1 million reflecting a decline of $58 million or roughly 11% versus the fourth quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/26/gamestop-corp-new-gme-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2019 Q4","e":"gme","d":"2020-03-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Bell","x":"Adjusted operating income excluding transformation, severance and other charges, was $109.2 million compared to adjusted operating income of $202.5 million in the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/26/gamestop-corp-new-gme-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2020 Q1","e":"gme","d":"2020-06-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Bell","x":"After adjusting for roughly $5.3 million in transformation, severance and other charges associated with our GameStop Reboot profit improvement initiative, our SG&A expenses were $381.2 million, reflecting a decline of approximately $72.5 million or roughly 16% versus the first quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/06/09/gamestop-corp-new-gme-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"GME 2020 Q1","e":"gme","d":"2020-06-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Bell","x":"Adjusted operating loss, excluding the transformation, severance and other charges, was $98.8 million compared to